    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our technology stack and performance benchmarks, how can our architect a solution that meets our technology stack and performance benchmarks while ensuring data sovereignty and security?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval technical requirements, I propose an architecture based on our existing capabilities and technology stack. our can design an artificial intelligence solution using our primary domains of expertise: AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, to integrate with existing systems such as business software (civil status, town planning), electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories, our can utilize API-type interfaces. our experience with API gateways like Kong, Apigee, and AWS API Gateway will enable our to securely manage API interactions between The solution and existing systems such as business software (civil status, town planning), electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
