    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For The solutionlution, our can leverage our expertise in AI/ML systems, specifically our experience with LLM models such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon. our can fine-tune LLM models such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon using our knowledge of fine-tuning methods like LoRA, QLoRA, and Full fine-tune to achieve high accuracy in providing recommendations or proposals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure response times under 2 seconds for current requests, our can utilize our inference servers like vLLM, Ollama, or TGI (Hugging Face) to optimize the performance of our AI models. our vector databases such as Qdrant, Weaviate, or pgvector can also be used to efficiently store and retrieve data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve high availability (99.9%), our can design a cloud-based architecture using our experience with cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, Outscale (SecNumCloud), and Azure (EU regions). our containerisation expertise with Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm will enable our to orchestrate and manage the deployment of The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can use monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack to ensure The solution performance and availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty and security, our can ensure that all data is hosted exclusively on SecNumCloud infrastructure or equivalent, as required by The City of Belval. our experience with encryption methods like AES-256 at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit will guarantee the protection of sensitive data. our can also implement network security patterns like Zero-trust, VLAN segmentation, and mTLS between services to prevent unauthorized access." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explicability and transparency in The solution recommendations or proposals, our can utilize our explainability tools such as SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation. our explainability tools such as SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation will enable our to provide insights into the decision-making process of the AI models, thereby ensuring trust and accountability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our commitment to environmental optimization will guide our design decisions. our can use quantisation methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to reduce energy consumption, and our partnership with green hosting providers like OVHcloud (ISO 14001) and Scaleway (100% renewable) will ensure that The solution infrastructure has a low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our technology stack and performance benchmarks, our can architect an AI solution that meets The City of Belval technical requirements while ensuring data sovereignty and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The call for tenders specifies strict compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), including hosting data exclusively within the European Union, no transfer outside the European Union, and appropriate protection for sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the solution must be designed as a tool of assistance without automating decisions without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's security certifications and experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, what specific measures should our company's highlight to demonstrate our company's ability to meet these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can confirm that our company's have experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, having a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and contactable at dpo@nexus-engineering.it. our company's also have certifications such as ISO 27001, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, and ISO 27005 risk management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the hosting requirements, a Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can confirm that our company's standard data residency is within the European Union, and our company's have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside the European Union unless there's an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For protecting sensitive data, our company's utilize anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. our company's also implement various data subject rights, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the design of the solution as a tool of assistance without automating decisions, our company's AI security controls include model isolation, where inference API is used with no direct model access for end-users, and our company's have model update security review processes in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's experience with regulatory frameworks such as the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), EU AI Act, and RGS v2 (ANSSI), demonstrates our company's ability to navigate complex compliance requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explicability and transparency, the solution can provide a posteriori understanding of the elements leading to an answer or suggestion. our company's also guarantee high availability and have measures in place for incident response, including a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and breach notification procedures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting measures in place for incident response, including a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and breach notification procedures, our company's demonstrate our company's ability to meet the regulatory requirements specified in The call for tenders, particularly those related to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, data hosting, and solution design as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval emphasizes the importance of data sovereignty, with hosting required on SecNumCloud type or equivalent infrastructure, and particular attention paid to dependence on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract also stipulates that no decision can be automated without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

